abstract: >-
  pw-emit is a shared emitter library that renders Playwright TypeScript Page
  Objects, spec files, and project scaffolds from a generic intermediate
  representation. Powers both @vijaypjavvadi/sel2pw (Selenium-to-Playwright AST
  converter) and @vijaypjavvadi/bdd2pw (Gherkin-to-Playwright scaffolder with
  Microsoft Playwright MCP integration) downstream. The separation-of-concerns
  architecture ensures structurally consistent Playwright output across two
  fundamentally different input domains.
